    {
      "id": 3004379477741488,
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "## PAI / Claude Code Telemetry\n\n### Sections\n1. **Overview** - Key metrics at a glance\n2. **Session Activity** - Session lifecycle patterns\n3. **Tool Usage** - Tool utilization breakdown\n4. **Subagent Performance** - Multi-agent orchestration\n5. **Skill Usage** - Skill invocations and workflow triggers\n6. **Token Consumption** - Cost optimization insights\n7. **Event Analytics** - Hook event flow\n8. **Detailed Tables** - Raw data exploration\n\n### Key Metrics\n- **Cache Hit Rate**: >50% target, >80% excellent\n- **Avg Duration**: Monitor for anomalies\n- **Tokens/Tool Use**: Lower = more efficient\n- **Skills**: Track which skills are most used\n\n### Template Variables\n- `$env` - Filter by environment\n- `$service` - Filter by service\n- `$user` - Filter by user",
        "background_color": "white",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "vertical_align": "top",
        "show_tick": false,
        "tick_pos": "50%",
        "tick_edge": "left",
        "has_padding": true
      }
    }
